# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Anonymized replication package for peer review.
#
# Two reproduction paths:
#   full      raw provider downloads -> code/work_dataframe.Rmd -> the panels
#   results   the committed panels   -> code/starlink_results.Rmd -> everything
#
# Only the second path's inputs are committed. The raw archives (about 2.2 GB)
# are public and documented in README.md with URLs and access dates, and the
# pipeline intermediates under data/processed/ are rebuilt by work_dataframe.Rmd.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# --- manuscript ------------------------------------------------------------
# Excluded in full: submitted through the journal, and not anonymized.
manuscript/

# --- data ------------------------------------------------------------------
# Default-deny, then re-include exactly what code/starlink_results.Rmd reads,
# plus the two small hand-built inputs that cannot be downloaded.
data/*
!data/cmdty_price_anonormal.RDS
!data/cmdty_price_monthly.RDS
!data/dataset_normalyr.RDS
!data/dataset_prodesyr.RDS
!data/ipca_mensal_sidra.csv
!data/prodes_source.txt

!data/processed/
data/processed/*
!data/processed/figure1_deter_2022_2024.RDS
!data/processed/figure1_mobile_coverage.RDS
!data/processed/figure_ax_deter_fire_2021_2024.RDS
!data/processed/mun_zone.RDS
!data/processed/spei12_copernicus_era5_normalyr.RDS
!data/processed/spei12_copernicus_era5_prodesyr.RDS
!data/processed/starlink_normalyr.RDS

# Hand-coded from the Cartografias reports; not a provider download.
!data/raw/
data/raw/*
!data/raw/FBSP/
data/raw/FBSP/*
!data/raw/FBSP/amazon_factions_2023_2024.csv

# --- code ------------------------------------------------------------------
code/Rplots.pdf

# The rendered results document is committed so the output can be read without
# running anything. Its knitr side-car folders are not needed: it is
# self-contained, with figures embedded as base64.
code/*_files/
code/*_cache/

# --- R session -------------------------------------------------------------
.Rproj.user/
.Rhistory
.RData
.Ruserdata
